  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.20.0: New public API — ChatPanel.GroupDisplayNameResolver and ComposeBar.GroupDisplayNameResolver (Func<string, string?>) so hosts can map raw ProviderType IDs (e.g., \"Custom_046A…\") to readable display names (e.g., \"MiniMax\") in the model picker group headers and the selected-model summary; falls back to the raw ProviderType (Mock → \"demo\") when unset. Greeting picks one of seven localized variants per render (en-US + ko-KR). Empty-state header now falls back to the greeting whenever Title is empty — switching the model mid-conversation no longer clobbers an auto-generated/user-edited title, and a transient pre-first-reply state no longer flashes the model id. Thinking block anchors above the streamed assistant text (matches tool-block placement). ChatPanel.Dispose now resets imperative per-tab state (current turn, edit-mode flag, draft text, attachments, workspace folders, KB selection, conversation-active flag) so a recycled container can't leak the previous tab's UI state into the next. Rebuilt against same Core 0.19.1 + Ai.Providers 0.7.2.",
